{"id": "EUVD-2026-102972", "enisaUuid": "0459cb51-6f83-352c-91ad-f5307e26f273", "description": "EFAK through 5.1.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated low-privilege users to manage accounts because the /api/users endpoints lack administrator role checks. Attackers can send POST, PUT, or DELETE requests to UserController to grant themselves ROLE_ADMIN, create administrators, or delete users, gaining control of managed Kafka clusters.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:39", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:17:35", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/efak-missing-admin-gate-user-management-api", "https://github.com/smartloli/EFAK/blob/v5.1.0/efak-web/src/main/java/org/kafka/eagle/web/security/config/WebSecurityConfig.java#L89-L93", "https://github.com/smartloli/EFAK/blob/v5.1.0/efak-web/src/main/java/org/kafka/eagle/web/controller/UserController.java#L218-L302", "https://github.com/smartloli/EFAK", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/efak-through-5.1.0-privilege-escalation-via-api-users-rest-api"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111681", "GHSA-64mr-r26w-689m"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b8c1c4b5-00f8-3789-9902-1be415837d0d", "product": {"name": "EFAK", "vendor": {"name": "smartloli"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 \u22645.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c569ba64-7418-3a6b-ba49-83006bb0f572", "vendor": {"name": "smartloli"}}], "isExploited": false}